The synthesis paradigm completely outperforms direct generation across every dimension:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Flawless Reliability ($100\%$ Accuracy):} Every single generated solver successfully implemented an exact depth-first search with constraint propagation (e.g., minimum remaining values heuristic).

